Spec: Spec elevates MDCFG cascade-lock from 'should' to 'must' and clarifies entry priority override: locking a domain entry requires all predecessor domain entries also be locked, otherwise an attacker manipulates the unlocked predecessor's tail to inject or remove entries in the locked domain, defeating IOPMP isolation.
